  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Prepositioning Initiative (RPI)  for sexual and reproductive health supplies (Phase 3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding under this initiative supports the United Nations Population Fund (UNFPA) to preposition Sexual and Reproductive Health (SRH) and Gender Based Violence (GBV) commodities across identified disaster-prone countries in the Indo-Pacific region, for rapid distribution in the event of humanitarian crises.</narrative>
  </description>
